Autonomous agents
Autonomous agents are AI teammates that handle complex, multi-step tasks independently and surface results for seller review. Full access to all agents requires Sales Premium.

Sales Qualification Agent - Researches incoming leads against your ideal customer profile, evaluates BANT criteria (Budget, Authority, Need, Timeline), and initiates outreach to high-fit leads. Sellers pick up conversations only after the agent completes initial qualification.

Sales Opportunity Agent - Monitors active opportunities for risk signals like disengaged stakeholders, communication gaps, or competitive pressure. Surfaces action cards with deal health insights to help sellers prioritize the right deals.

Sales Close Agent - Handles personalized outreach and follow-up for high-volume sales motions like renewals or transactional deals using customizable playbooks.

Sales Research Agent - Lets sellers and managers ask questions about pipeline and performance data in natural language. Delivers structured research outputs without requiring manual reports or data exports.

Advanced AI features
Sales Premium also includes:

Sales Accelerator - Guides sellers on their next course of action with timely, actionable insights from AI-driven work queues.
Relationship intelligence - Builds stronger customer relationships with AI-guided selling features like who knows whom, conversation intelligence, relationship analytics, and health scores.
Predictive models - Increases conversion and win rates using AI to prioritize leads and opportunities with predictive lead scoring, predictive opportunity scoring, and predictive forecasting.
Conversation intelligence - Analyzes recorded sales calls to surface sentiment, keywords, competitors mentioned, and coaching opportunities.
